                                "sense_id": "5aaee42d-b7d4-34b4-a98d-85da7c44c06f",
                                "text": "We focused on the nerve-agent feint, and got roundhoused by the insurgent hook."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13643146-8d82-4b57-99a4-bf3a955e3f87",
                                "sense_id": "5aaee42d-b7d4-34b4-a98d-85da7c44c06f",
                                "text": "I'm on my feet and my fist is roundhousing and I feel flesh. I hit again, and teeth crack under my fist. I hear voices and they're shouting and a light burns into my face."
